; Do NOT set `omit=optional` here — Rollup/esbuild ship required platform
; binaries (e.g. @rollup/rollup-win32-x64-msvc) as optional deps, and
; omitting all optional deps breaks the build on every platform.
;
; Vite auto-prefers `sass-embedded` over `sass` when both resolve, and npm
; auto-installs vite's optional peer deps including sass-embedded. A newer
; sass-embedded (1.100) fails compiling Bootstrap 5.3.0-alpha2's
; variables-dark.scss under this vendored Facit SCSS tree. There is no clean
; npm-config way to exclude just this one optional peer, so after any
; `npm install` that reintroduces it, run:
;   rm -rf node_modules/sass-embedded